  <name>YouNeeK Death Terminal</name>
  <summary>Brutalist GPU terminal emulator</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      YouNeeK Death Terminal is a GPU-accelerated terminal emulator with
      AI command suggestions, tabs and split panes, a built-in SSH client,
      and sandboxed Lua plugins.
    </p>
    <p>
      Vulkan is used when a driver is available. Otherwise the terminal
      falls back to software rendering.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.youneek.DeathTerminal.desktop</launchable>
  <provides>
    <binary>deathterminal</binary>
  </provides>
